	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">De <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensibus</placeName> multa feruntur absurda, quę lubens praetereo.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Legi literas 6. Septembris <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>datas, in quibus hęc inerant: concionatores nihil sui officii praetermittere atque sic perstituros; deinde <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>adhuc spem esse, eo quod adhuc semel referenda sit res ad concilium magnum; Cęsarem quoque <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>vix permissurum, quę ab ipsis petantur; tum ergo cognitum iri, quid sit in animo; pręterea eun<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>dem properare praeter expectationem omnium in <placeName ref="l808">Belgas</placeName>, sive quod advenerit filius, sive quod aliquid <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>motum sit illic.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Qua de re spargitur nonnihil, sed incertum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Tria rumor circum fert:</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">1. esse civitatem <placeName ref="l631">Burgundicam</placeName> in confiniis regni <placeName ref="l832">Francici</placeName>; eo missos <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>inquisitores, et qui inventi sint Lutherani, male tractatos; concurrisse itaque cives et occidis<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>se omnes sacerdotes Baales, papales dico, et sese devovisse <placeName ref="l832">Gall.</placeName></s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>2. Bis milites adversarios duce comite a <placeName ref="l1716">Mansfelden</placeName> fusos; reginam <placeName ref="l882">Ungarię</placeName> sic turbatam, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ut fugientem in quoddam monasterium mors sit sequuta.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>3. <placeName ref="l168">Gandavum</placeName> receptum a suis idque hoc pacto; Gubernator, qui fuit in arce nova extructa ab <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>imperatore, mortem obiit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Convenit ingens civium multitudo ad funus atque, dum arx fuit aperta, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cives irruperunt et occuparunt literis protinus scriptis ad <persName ref="p20225">Gallum</persName>, ut facinus tueatur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">His igitur <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>tam diu fruaris, dum alia supervenient, quibus certius instrueris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Es hand die <placeName ref="l267">Cölnischen</placeName> schifflüt geseyt, si habint dem kaiser gfuͤrt büchsen etc. nün<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>mal hundert tusig centner.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Serium est, quod virum urget, quicquid sit<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/><persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName> se misisse ait, quę toties petisti.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale fortis in domino, qui solus fortes efficit ac con<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>stantes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 13. Septembris anno 1548.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Salvi sint <persName ref="p8171">Theodorus</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanus</persName>, <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherus</persName>, <persName ref="p8459">Otto</persName> in Christo Iesu.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Tuus <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><persName ref="p8418">Os[valdus] Myc[onius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, ministro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Christi fortissimo, domino in Christo s<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>uo.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
